{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S05—S09：部分痛楚具体化为怕被嫌黏、怕对方不再需要自己，略带有对被接纳和被需要的焦虑。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S03—S04：额外突出确认对方是否有同样的感情、是否会觉得自己造成负担，使焦点稍偏向感情是否互相、表达是否给对方压力。\",\n    \"S13：把核心矛盾更集中地落实为想索取一份永远不变的承诺，以及因得不到承诺而想自我保护，容易把主题收窄为对关系确定性的渴求。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X更完整地让亲密当下的幸福与未来无法保证的痛楚相互渗透，尤其S13对保证本身也无法真正消除不确定性的追问，以及S14甜酸并存却不后悔的落点，都直接回应Center。Y也写出了留不住的痛，但额外强化了相互确认、避免给对方负担和索取承诺，使主线稍偏向关系中的安全感问题。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "81b6eeaf-6758-4e23-b36a-d933c867dd8a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T094347849370Z", "elapsed_seconds": 42.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:44:29.985945+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2c6b9855465693fcd59bafe7cd5f7a7ac718375fcd54e2501e7a4d4e11465e94", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_atta